{"stdout":"  "Xi Jinping paid a state visit to Washington from 23 to 25 September. The White House fact sheet, dated 25 September, states: 'The two countries established the U.S.-China Super Intelligence (SI) Dialogue to exchange views on risks and benefits related to SI. The next exchange will occur by November 2026. The United States and China also agreed to establish a bilateral communication channel for SI incidents.' It adds that the two leaders agreed to use the term super intelligence rather than artificial intelligence.",
